{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_02_g",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:cb39625ac2b518f880f37a765ea40ab99f5bc64258804ec8bd843cb40b241257",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_g:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12c99ebd2bc4c0fb20d4aa4ea4ca4e88cf2c18185005eb8f7023617054520fb1",
      "text": "《成为万物的万人迷！》录制当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_g:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72dfd53f8e7864ef259d3d5907f46041a9ddfa34c03998ac1e85bb8b8b67108a",
      "text": "好，《成为万物的万人迷！》正式开始了！\n本次出演的偶像是Jupiter的三位！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_g:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bcfcade3cc5c09d06d02fe05ff074478df39c7ea8949674e70381f0e27af751f",
      "text": "三位将要撩台下的男女老少观众，\n争夺谁才是真正的万人迷！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_g:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7b60998f834f194024afc07be0ca11e57fca017bbb753123bbbbbfc46aa83eb",
      "text": "那套西装穿得笔挺，真帅气。\n超级适合您哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_g:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb60dd1bc51188040c50ec11b7b3f5077be954db1b191db557ab1535587d3d9",
      "text": "能再多聊聊吗？\n和您的交谈，真的非常愉快。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_g:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e1ec0e327a11323c8a2f23267c820f11f7a2e09bc9280a935b03877cc971a7a",
      "text": "哇……大姐姐好时尚啊！\n也能教教我时尚的诀窍吗～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_g:cmd-000099:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7e2ddd5810334360adf568845ca28812512fb6bab32a63d6196a2e783e71873",
      "text": "前半场结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_g:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bb0a13d2a86b6f49b744b24aa0eefaad0458aebe1d31537c5ec65fd74f2c113",
      "text": "大家辛苦了！\n前半场的排名结果已经出来了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_g:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ffa65823dd72a87dbed37dbb3569ce488fe29013c7194f0cc88b619b9483912",
      "text": "哦，快让我看看！……诶，北斗是最后一名！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_g:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea43f92c73a29b4f81f6042bf7e69513f930a70c8b303d9646d2e37cdf5cde27",
      "text": "哎～真意外啊～。\n我还以为冬马君肯定是最后一名呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_g:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e829de5043a45de41fbd7a75fdbe5c26f4bc921677dd831fb4f8943f404dbae",
      "text": "我也……等等，为什么啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_g:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f984e241d36b24a524c6ad5c5c0516538aaccb25ac786c6b97f3da1a2c358459",
      "text": "因为你跟女孩子搭话的时候超害羞的嘛。\n在旁边看着我都觉得难为情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_g:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8b5b40e5a7804de3ac5c299273a2b9bde4f1955cbcff39276188f6692d9835f",
      "text": "不过，有评论说“这一点很可爱”哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_g:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff92280f17c25f9e0fb71948d738360a86a5079173bb22e42432eefe0f32f02a",
      "text": "那么，给我的评论是……。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
